hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28","[AI-translation] Kutoka kwa Ibn Abbas (Allah amridhie) alisema: Sura al-An'am iliteremshwa Makka usiku kwa mkupuo mmoja, ikiizunguka malaika elfu sabini wakiinua sauti kuzunguka kwayo kwa tasbihi."
"29","[AI-translation] Ilipoteremshwa Sura al-An'am, Mtume wa Allah (ﷺ) alimtukuza Allah akasema: Hakika sura hii imeandamana na malaika waliojaza upeo wa macho."
"30","[AI-translation] Kutoka kwa Abu Lubaba (Allah amridhie) alisema: A'isha (Allah amridhie) alisema: Nabii (ﷺ) hakulala hadi asome (sura) az-Zumar na Bani Isra'il."
